# Mounted into postgres at /docker-entrypoint-initdb.d (runs once, on an empty
# data volume, in alphabetical order). The database + login role are created from
# the POSTGRES_* env vars in compose.yaml — that is the bootstrap.
#
# Engine event/outbox TABLES are NOT created here: they are owned by Epic A.1
# migrations (the engine runs them on startup). Drop *.sql / *.sh files here only
# for stack-level seed that is not the engine's schema.
